F_0dcd8 Board_Init
@Board_Init Board_Init(): draws the empty checkerboard onto the background screen.
F_0dce6 Board_Free
@Board_Free Board_Free(): frees BOARD.BSB.
F_0dcf4 Board_DrawCheckerboard
@Board_DrawCheckerboard Board_DrawCheckerboard(a0 = screen): clears the screen and draws the
@Board_DrawCheckerboard 12x9 board with alternating tiles from x = 128.
F_0dd6e Board_RedrawTile
@Board_RedrawTile Board_RedrawTile(d0 = row, d1 = column): redraws the plain checker tile of
@Board_RedrawTile one cell on the background screen (used when the board spins).
F_0ddd0 Board_GetPalette
@Board_GetPalette Board_GetPalette() -> a0: the palette loaded from BOARD.PAL.
F_0ddd8 Board_SetColours
@Board_SetColours Board_SetColours(d0 = index 0-3): picks a pair of ST colours from
