# ------------------------------------------------------------------ credits
F_0e1f0 Credits_Load
@Credits_Load Credits_Load(): loads CREDITS.TXT from the link file and stores its size.
F_0e21a Credits_Init
@Credits_Init Credits_Init(): empty hook.
F_0e21c Credits_Free
@Credits_Free Credits_Free(): frees the credits text.
F_0e22a Credits_ScrollStep
@Credits_ScrollStep Credits_ScrollStep(): one frame of the credits scroller. Every 8 lines it
@Credits_ScrollStep prints the next text line centred below the visible area (font 2, "@" at the
@Credits_ScrollStep start = colour 1 heading) and mirrors it 216 lines up; then it moves the video
@Credits_ScrollStep base down one line (hardware scroll over a 216-line loop) and waits a VBL.
F_0e38c Credits_Begin
@Credits_Begin Credits_Begin(): plays music 11, fades to black, clears the three screens, sets
@Credits_Begin the credits palette and resets the text position and scroll line.
F_0e3e2 Credits_Run
@Credits_Run Credits_Run(): whole credits sequence: Credits_Begin, scroll until the end of the
@Credits_Run text, fade to black over 128 frames, clear the screens.
F_0e436 Credits_CopyBand
@Credits_CopyBand Credits_CopyBand(a0 = src, a1 = dst): copies 8 screen lines (8 x 160 bytes).
F_0e452 Credits_ClearBand
@Credits_ClearBand Credits_ClearBand(a0 = dst): clears 8 screen lines (8 x 160 bytes).
B_2d06a gCreditsText
B_2d06e gCreditsSize
B_2d072 gCreditsPos
B_2d076 gCreditsScrollLine

