F_103f6 LevelSelect_RedrawAllOff
@LevelSelect_RedrawAllOff LevelSelect_RedrawAllOff(): flags all 25 buttons to be drawn "off".
F_10410 LevelSelect_RedrawAllTicks
@LevelSelect_RedrawAllTicks LevelSelect_RedrawAllTicks(): flags all 25 ticks for redraw.
F_1042a LevelSelect_DrawBackground
@LevelSelect_DrawBackground LevelSelect_DrawBackground(): builds the level-select background
@LevelSelect_DrawBackground from SELECT.PI1, the title sprite for the mode (B_234f0) and the
@LevelSelect_DrawBackground blank panel, then copies it to both screens.
F_1052c LevelSelect_GetPalette
@LevelSelect_GetPalette LevelSelect_GetPalette() -> a0: the SELECT.PI1 palette.
F_10536 LevelSelect_ClearPreview
@LevelSelect_ClearPreview LevelSelect_ClearPreview(): restores the preview area of the back
@LevelSelect_ClearPreview screen from SELECT.PI1 (F_161d0).
F_1056c LevelSelect_DrawLevelName
@LevelSelect_DrawLevelName LevelSelect_DrawLevelName(): restores the name strip from SELECT.PI1
@LevelSelect_DrawLevelName and prints the current level's name centred at (160,83) with font 0.
F_105c8 LevelSelect_DrawTimeIcon
@LevelSelect_DrawTimeIcon LevelSelect_DrawTimeIcon(): when B_234ee == 3 (timed mode), draws
@LevelSelect_DrawTimeIcon LEVTIME.BSB at (10,122).
F_10614 LevelSelect_DrawBestTime
@LevelSelect_DrawBestTime LevelSelect_DrawBestTime(): when B_234ee == 3 and flagged, prints the
@LevelSelect_DrawBestTime selected level's best time (B_2a894) as "mm:ss" at y = 130.
F_10692 LevelSelect_DrawTotalTime
@LevelSelect_DrawTotalTime LevelSelect_DrawTotalTime(): when B_234ee == 3 and flagged, prints the
@LevelSelect_DrawTotalTime sum of the 25 best times as "mm:ss" at y = 150.
F_10718 LevelSelect_ReloadLowMem
@LevelSelect_ReloadLowMem LevelSelect_ReloadLowMem(): low-memory mode only: takes the 8
@LevelSelect_ReloadLowMem level-select graphics from asset cache page 3 and relocates them.
